    "detailed_description": "Under the influence of the Cthulhu deity, waves of evil continue to surge, turning creatures into unruly beings through a curse. The choice is yours to rise up and resist. Choose your holy relics, and enhance your weapons. Unleash a hail of bullets on your enemies with your fully equipped arsenal! Can you survive in this endless wave of evil?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMaliceWave is a 2D pixel bullet hell game. Enemies respawn with each wave. You can enter the store to purchase weapons and items to power up.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDiverse Weapons and Holy Relics: Choose from a variety of weapons and relics to aid in your survival.<br />\r\nHundreds of Items and Weapons: With hundreds of items and weapons to choose from, including those inspired by the styles of Cthulhu, mechanics, and magic, you'll always have new strategies to try.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdd our discord for latest update!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nhttps://discord.gg/GzgBKFQc7f",
